  "notes": "Both images show the same ESP32-S3-LCD-Driver-Board artwork (silkscreen name visible); transcribed from each image separately. Silkscreen spellings printed under each pad (3V3, G, TX, RX, E4, 15 ...) are first in functions; PWM symbols, legend and category colors omitted. The GPIO39 callout prints SUBSPICSI with a final glyph that looks like the letter I (no flag as on the 1 in TOUCH1); copied as printed. The small white connector at the bottom has no pin labels and is skipped."
